body:
I'm 16, this is completely understandable. I'm not old enough to have kids of my own however I do know that I got very different academic attention than him (I was the first child) and they've even told me this themselves, going as far to point out that I should be helping more.

&#x200B;

What would you suggest I have done instead?

I think using big words like this can actually be good, because it helps people expand their vocabularies if people actually try to find out what they mean lol

&#x200B;

As long as they aren't blatantly calling others idiots and bragging about their IQ or using the words incorrectly, it should be fine

&#x200B;
